[00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:37.460]   actually love the product and selling the reasons founders want them to.
[00:00:37.460 --> 00:00:38.880]   Can such a gap develop?
[00:00:38.880 --> 00:00:39.880]   Absolutely.
[00:00:39.880 --> 00:00:44.120]   The founder is usually thinking about the future, implementing exciting new features that align
[00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:48.520]   with a vision of not only what the product should be, but, more importantly, to them,
[00:00:48.520 --> 00:00:50.240]   how it should properly be used.
[00:00:50.240 --> 00:00:54.780]   Meanwhile, back in the trenches of reality, overworked directors and VPs are buying the
