[00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200]   This is an audio version of a Dave Kellogg post from September 6, 2024 titled "You've
[00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.760]   been asked to be a startup advisor, now what?" "You're fired," said the general counsel,
