[00:00:31.440 --> 00:00:38.640]   I picked this topic because I wanted to force myself to learn more about it, the reason I write many Kellogg posts, and that process seems to have worked.
[00:00:38.640 --> 00:00:44.400]   I started out asking how will SaaS Metrics change because of AI? That led me quickly to pricing models.
[00:00:44.400 --> 00:00:50.400]   And that led me all the way back to the existing weaknesses in SaaS Metrics created by violations of the simple SaaS model,
