[00:02:49.360 --> 00:02:54.000]   NRR. If I were writing a fintech piece, I could write about how cleaner data means better fraud
[00:02:54.000 --> 00:02:59.280]   detection means less fraud detection means less fraud means reduced fraud costs means high,
[00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:04.560]   jare profits. So the question becomes, are there benefits that you can reasonably enumerate?
[00:03:04.560 --> 00:03:08.080]   At some point, you have to know what someone wants in order to climb the advantages stack.
[00:03:08.080 --> 00:03:12.080]   But even here, I think I could do better. Our metadata platform helps you build a superior
[00:03:12.080 --> 00:03:16.800]   data infrastructure to drive your organization's data culture, help analysts build better models,
