[00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:26.080]   marketing, and operations. It's not great. Look, this is a tricky marketing problem.
[00:03:26.080 --> 00:03:29.680]   We're trying to climb a generic advantages stack in a way that results in more compelling
[00:03:29.680 --> 00:03:34.080]   messages than save money by working smarter. Here's what I did to try and improve it.
[00:03:34.080 --> 00:03:38.720]   Knowing that CDOs buy data platforms, I tuned the message towards CDO priorities which I can learn
[00:03:38.720 --> 00:03:43.040]   through market research. I know that CDOs see their job as building enterprise data infrastructure,
